\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15.1}{\ignorespaces Wardley map showing the evolution of the middle management role from information routing (commodity, automatable) toward judgment brokerage (genesis/custom-built, irreducible). The horizontal axis represents evolutionary stage; the vertical axis represents value chain position.}}{110}{figure.caption.22}%
