\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {18.1}{\ignorespaces The compound organisational flywheel. Discovery feeds codification; codification feeds validation by the judgment broker; validated workflows propagate through the mesh; propagation increases organisational capability; increased capability accelerates the next cycle of discovery. Each revolution makes the next one faster.}}{142}{figure.caption.27}%
